'' A relative '#include' after a '#line' resolves against the presented name.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/pp/src/line-include.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered

'' src/lineinc/target.bi, reached only through the '#line' name...
